      "role": "user",
      "content": "omg im so sorry im such a mess but my little boy is so sick and i'm staring at this amoxicillin bottle and i feel like i'm gonna cry. his ear is so red and he won't stop crying. he's 15kg and the docs said 40mg per kg a day so i think that's 600mg total... but the bottle says 125mg per 5ml. i'm trying to do the math in my head and it feels like it's gonna be a huge amount of liquid? can u help me figure out exactly how many ml i should be giving him so i don't mess this up?? i just want him to feel better asap thank u",
